						 <p>I love this series. I just finished a re-read. It's in all the best veins of Stross, Rucker, Vinge, Rajaniemi, Qntm, Martinez, (please share any recommendations of other novelists?).</p> <p>Great universe, fabulous whiplash sentences, musical plot. Thank you for sharing it with us. :) I do hope it continues in the future.</p> <p>p.s. kudos to the translators!</p> 
