					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=30aGtXWo0SU">&quot;Notice me, senpai!&quot; they cry when I choke their speak</a><br /> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=30aGtXWo0SU">I'll set this crooked city on fire to light the smokery</a><br /> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=30aGtXWo0SU">Old timers speak of us hushed and clutch their rosaries</a><br /> <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=30aGtXWo0SU">I lust after greatness, I'm aiming right at its ovaries</a></p> </blockquote> <p>Banner created by <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/zhange-artwork">Zhange</a>.</p> <p>The depiction of Oneiroi shown in this series was created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2038009&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="TyGently" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2038009)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" >TyGently</a></span>, and first appeared in their series <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/comedown-machine-hub">Comedown Machine</a>.</p> <p>Alliott Chao was created by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="Taffeta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" >Taffeta</a></span>, and first appeared in <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-dedekind-infinite-demographic">The Dedekind Infinite Demographic</a>.</p> <p>I owe a massive debt to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2038009&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="TyGently" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2038009)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" >TyGently</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tawny0" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2244665&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="tawny0" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2244665)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tawny0" >tawny0</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2221240&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="Taffeta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2221240)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" >Taffeta</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jekeled" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1349098&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="Jekeled" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1349098)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jekeled" >Jekeled</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" >minmin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3938622&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="The Great Hippo" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3938622)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" >The Great Hippo</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1814684&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="GreenWolf" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1814684)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" >GreenWolf</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1238719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571854751" alt="ch00bakka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1238719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" >ch00bakka</a></span> for grinding through almost every single tale in this series multiple times and helping me lock down the characterization, action, prose, and continuity. Speed Demon would not exist without them.</p> <p>Strap in, folks &#8212; you're in for a hell of a ride.</p> 
